      "y": 1461.0,
      "width": 795.76,
      "height": 17.5,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "text": "  1. At startup, each pack is indexed. An ask's category and interaction type then give its @type.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "  1. At startup, each pack is indexed. An ask's category and interaction type then give its @type.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 128561,
      "isDeleted": false,
