      "x": 80,
      "y": 1485.0,
      "width": 779.52,
      "height": 17.5,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "text": "  2. For discovery, the search is for that @type. A pack that needs a place adds a place filter.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "  2. For discovery, the search is for that @type. A pack that needs a place adds a place filter.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
